+`observation.id`, `timing.tcl`, the SDK producer/parser and their captured
+reporter dependencies. SDK/reporter nonzero exits keep their exit receipts;
+diagnostic grep no-match is normal, while matches or grep/file/tool errors fail.
+Normal completion requires matching before/after RBF hashes. The collector and
+both timing/exclusion gates remain separate mandatory checks. Neither a new
+payload nor host mock qualification changes an old failed shell outcome or
